# WS3-09 expectation for 360-determinism.sh, written before the run. Sources:
# spec/17-codegen.md §11 ("Same source, same profile, same flags produce
# byte-identical C: stable symbol names, stable temporary numbering, stable drop
# order, no timestamps and no absolute paths (only the logical source path, in
# #line)") and spec/13-data-inclusion.md §3.
# Expected: a2 and b identical to a (repeat and debug clc); no date/time string; c
# may differ only in the #line path spelling if the logical path is the path as
# given; d contains no absolute path. If d embeds the absolute path, the meaning of
